[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16202.87, "timestamp": "04:30:02", "text": "所以，這個地方已經完成了80%。  等等，那是櫻花"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16204.95, "timestamp": "04:30:04", "text": "葉，對吧？  那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16208.469, "timestamp": "04:30:08", "text": "小櫻。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16230.63, "timestamp": "04:30:30", "text": "。等等，是櫻桃橡木"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16250.03, "timestamp": "04:30:50", "text": "。有白色和粉紅色。是的。"}]